      },
      "lineNbr": 925,
      "author": {
        "id": 1088085
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-03-04T19:57:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Moved the calloc into if clause. Otherwise I thought about let the caller allocate the memory, which is less clean..",
      "parentUuid": "975b5099_d7ab65e2",
      "revId": "ce7653a0e086635bb0d66eef834ff99a32d60492",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
